flowchart TB
  subgraph CLIENT[Client and edge]
    UI[Web React / Next.js or mobile] --> CDN[CDN + WAF]
    CDN --> LB[Load balancer / ingress]
  end
  LB --> API[FastAPI REST API / OpenAPI]
  LB --> WS[Optional WebSocket gateway]

  subgraph APP[Python modular application - deploy together initially]
    IAM[Identity / tenant / roles]
    AUTH[Authoring / question bank / quiz versions]
    ATT[Attempts / server timer / autosave / submit]
    GRADE[Grading / results / appeals]
    ADMIN[Admin / audit / support]
    ANALYTICS[Analytics / reporting]
    NOTIFY[Notification service]
  end

  API --> IAM
  API --> AUTH
  API --> ATT
  API --> GRADE
  API --> ADMIN
  API --> ANALYTICS
  WS --> ATT

  APP --> PG[(PostgreSQL - source of truth)]
  APP --> REDIS[(Redis - cache / rate limits / ephemeral state)]
  AUTH --> OBJ[(Object storage - media / exports)]
  APP --> Q[Durable task queue]
  NOTIFY --> Q
  Q --> WORK[Python workers - email / exports / reports]
  WORK --> PG
  WORK --> OBJ
  WORK --> MAIL[Email / SMS provider]
